%description:
Tests an ICMPv6 Packet Too Big for a Fast Open SYN with data in SYN_SENT
(pmtudEnabled), the IPv6 form of tcp_icmp_frag_syn_1. The error reports an MTU
of 1400, so the client lowers its MSS to 1340 (1400 less 60 bytes of headers),
and it retransmits at once a bare SYN (A002) whose MSS option announces 1340.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 5s
*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tSend=0s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=700B
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientNoCookieRequired = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenAcceptWithoutCookie = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true
*.*_tcp.mss = 1460
*.cli_tcp.pmtudEnabled = true
*.tcptester.script="a1 icmp6 2 0 mtu 1400"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:700(700) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# answering with an ICMP error
[0.003 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
PMTUD: reducing snd_mss from 1460 to 1340 (reported MTU=1400)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
The SYN carried data: retransmitting a bare SYN at once
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Tcp Header Option MSS(=1340) sent
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
